<view class="page compose-page">
  <view class="row"><view class="eyebrow">01 · 先留下发生的事</view><text class="small">{{editing ? '已保存的观察' : '新手记'}}</text></view>
  <view class="title">这一刻，我看见…</view>
  <view class="subtitle">保留动作、原话与情境，给理解留一点空间。</view>
  <view wx:if="{{session.mode === 'demo'}}" class="notice demo-notice space">示例体验，请勿记录真实儿童信息。<button wx:if="{{!editing}}" class="quiet" bindtap="example">填入「积木倒下以后」示例</button></view>
  <view class="label">观察对象</view>
  <view class="chips"><button wx:for="{{kids}}" wx:key="id" class="chip {{item.on ? 'on' : ''}}" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="kid">{{item.name}}</button></view>
  <view wx:if="{{!kids.length}}" class="small">暂无可用名单，请先到「孩子」页添加观察对象。</view>
  <view class="label">当时的情境</view>
  <view class="chips"><button wx:for="{{scenes}}" wx:key="*this" class="chip {{scene === item ? 'on' : ''}}" data-value="{{item}}" bindtap="scene">{{item}}</button></view>
  <view class="notebook space"><textarea value="{{narrative}}" bindinput="text" maxlength="2000" auto-height="true" placeholder="例如：积木倒了，他扶住底下的一块，对同伴说……" cursor-spacing="160" adjust-position="{{true}}" hold-keyboard="{{true}}" show-confirm-bar="{{true}}"/><view class="small count">{{narrative.length}} / 2000</view></view>
  <view class="row space"><button class="secondary flex" bindtap="chooseMedia">照片 / 视频</button><button class="secondary flex" bindtap="voice">{{recording ? '结束录音' : '留一段声音'}}</button></view>
  <view class="small space">录音会保留为附件。需要转文字时，可用输入法语音，读一遍后再保存。</view>
  <view class="media-grid"><view wx:for="{{files}}" wx:key="id" class="media-item"><image wx:if="{{item.kind === 'photo'}}" src="{{item.path}}" mode="aspectFit"/><video wx:elif="{{item.kind === 'video'}}" src="{{item.path}}" controls="true"/><button wx:else="" class="secondary" bindtap="playAudio" data-id="{{item.id}}">播放录音</button><button wx:if="{{!item.existing}}" class="quiet" bindtap="removeFile" data-id="{{item.id}}">移除附件</button></view></view>
  <view class="row time-row"><text class="small">观察时间</text><picker mode="date" value="{{date}}" bindchange="date" disabled="{{editing}}"><text class="small">{{date}}</text></picker><picker mode="time" value="{{time}}" bindchange="time" disabled="{{editing}}"><text class="small">{{time}}</text></picker></view>
  <view wx:if="{{editing}}" class="small">保存后的时间与观察对象保持不变，实录修改保留首版原文。</view>
  <view wx:if="{{conflictText}}" class="notice space">待对照的本机草稿：{{conflictText}}</view>
  <view wx:if="{{original}}" class="notice space">首版实录：{{original}}</view>
  <view class="rule"></view>
  <view class="eyebrow">02 · 有空时，再看一眼</view>
  <view class="section-title space">这段经历，还能怎样理解？</view>
  <view class="small">AI只提出可能的线索，允许没有匹配。你可以先保存实录，稍后再回来。</view>
  <button class="secondary space" bindtap="prepare" loading="{{analyzing}}" disabled="{{analyzing || busy}}">{{analyzing ? '正在整理' : '请 AI 帮我找线索'}}</button>
  <view wx:if="{{aiMessage}}" class="notice space">{{aiMessage}}</view>
  <view wx:if="{{suggestions.length}}" class="small space">{{source === 'ai' ? '模型辅助 · 待专业核对' : '规则线索 · 未调用模型作判断'}}<text>
</text>以下为本项目整理的观察方向，均非《指南》逐字原文。</view>
  <view wx:for="{{suggestions}}" wx:key="id" class="clue"><view class="row"><text class="clue-title">{{item.goal}}</text><text class="small">{{item.domain}}</text></view><view class="evidence">“{{item.evidence}}”</view><view class="clue-copy">{{item.reason}}</view><view class="clue-next">继续观察 · {{item.next}}</view></view>
  <view class="space"><view class="section-title">判断，留在你手里。</view><view class="chips"><button class="chip {{review.decision === 'accepted' ? 'on' : ''}}" data-value="accepted" bindtap="decide">采纳线索</button><button class="chip {{review.decision === 'adjusted' ? 'on' : ''}}" data-value="adjusted" bindtap="decide">我来调整</button><button class="chip {{review.decision === 'ignored' ? 'on' : ''}}" data-value="ignored" bindtap="decide">仅留实录</button></view></view>
  <block wx:if="{{review.decision === 'accepted' || review.decision === 'adjusted'}}"><view class="label">教师的理解</view><textarea class="teacher-note" value="{{review.note}}" bindinput="note" maxlength="1000" auto-height="true" cursor-spacing="160" adjust-position="{{true}}" hold-keyboard="{{true}}" placeholder="结合当时的情境，你怎样理解这一次经历？"/><view class="label">下一次，我想继续留意</view><textarea class="teacher-note" value="{{review.next}}" bindinput="next" maxlength="400" auto-height="true" cursor-spacing="160" adjust-position="{{true}}" hold-keyboard="{{true}}" placeholder="写下一个值得继续观察的问题。"/></block>
  <view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error">{{error}}</view>
  <button wx:if="{{editing}}" class="quiet danger space" bindtap="remove">删除这条观察与附件</button>
  <view class="save-bar"><view class="small">{{draftStatus}} · {{reviewLabel}}。线索可稍后再看，先把实录留下。</view><button class="primary" bindtap="submit" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy || !canPost || analyzing}}">{{editing ? '保存修改' : '保存实录'}}</button></view>
</view>
<view wx:if="{{previewOpen}}" class="preview-mask"><view class="preview-sheet"><view class="section-title">发送前，再看一眼。</view><view class="small">已尝试隐藏名单内姓名、班级和常见联系方式。仍可能遗漏身份信息，请检查并只删改身份内容，保留事件事实。照片、视频和声音不会发送给模型。语音附件与自动转文字不是同一件事；本版不会把录音自动变成文字。</view><textarea value="{{previewText}}" bindinput="previewText" maxlength="2000" cursor-spacing="120" adjust-position="{{true}}"/><view class="privacy-buttons"><button class="secondary" bindtap="closePreview" disabled="{{analyzing}}">返回</button><button class="primary" bindtap="analyze" loading="{{analyzing}}" disabled="{{analyzing}}">检查好了，继续</button></view></view></view>
<view wx:if="{{showPrivacy}}" class="preview-mask"><view class="preview-sheet"><view class="section-title">使用照片与声音前</view><view class="subtitle">请阅读{{privacyContractName}}。教师的设备授权与监护人的儿童信息授权分别办理。</view><button class="quiet" bindtap="openPrivacyDoc">阅读隐私保护指引</button><view class="privacy-buttons"><button class="secondary" bindtap="onDisagreePrivacy">暂不使用</button><button id="agree-privacy-btn" class="primary" open-type="agreePrivacyAuthorization" bindagreeprivacyauthorization="onAgreePrivacy">同意并继续</button></view></view></view>
